Broadband adapter for the web player: the page carries Ethernet frames
through globalThis.flycastNet (see core/network/jsnet.h).

diff --git a/core/network/jsnet.h b/core/network/jsnet.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f451d51
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/network/jsnet.h
@@ -0,0 +1,110 @@
